flowchart TD
  A[Discover upstream or skill] --> B[Pin exact revision]
  B --> C[Acquire to quarantine]
  C --> D[Verify URL, commit, hashes]
  D --> E[Review license, notices and trademarks]
  E --> F[Scan dependencies, scripts and telemetry]
  F --> G[Review permissions and threat model]
  G --> H[Run isolated tests]
  H --> I{All gates pass?}
  I -- No --> X[Block, reject or request changes]
  I -- Yes --> J[Human-reviewed source decision]
  J --> K[Adapter or narrow import]
  K --> L[Conformance tests and SBOM]
  L --> M[Versioned release with rollback]
